  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-US\"><head><title>Family Camping - Helios School</title><meta name=\"page-published\" content=\"2026-09-01T17:00:00Z\"></head>\n<body><header id=\"fsHeader\"><nav aria-label=\"main\"><ul><li><a href=\"/about/about\">About Helios</a></li><li><a href=\"/student-life/family-camping\">Student Life</a></li></ul></nav></header>\n<main id=\"fsPageContent\" class=\"fsPageContent\"><h1 class=\"fsPageTitle\">Family Camping</h1>\n<div class=\"fsElement fsContent\"><div class=\"fsElementContent\"><p>Every fall the whole school camps together at <a href=\"/fs/pages/749\">Family Camping Weekend</a>, two nights at a state park campground an hour south.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"fsElement fsPanelGroup fsAccordion\"><div class=\"fsElementContent\"><ul class=\"fsTabsNav\" role=\"tablist\"><li><a href=\"#fs-panel-1\">What to Bring</a></li><li><a href=\"#fs-panel-2\">Meals</a></li></ul>\n<section class=\"fsElement fsPanel\"><header><h2 class=\"fsElementTitle\"><a href=\"#fs-panel-1\">What to Bring</a></h2></header><div class=\"fsElementContent\"><p>A tent, sleeping bags, headlamps and warm layers. The HCA lends tents to families who need one.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"fsElement fsPanel\"><header><h2 class=\"fsElementTitle\"><a href=\"#fs-panel-2\">Meals</a></h2></header><div class=\"fsElementContent\"><p>Saturday dinner is a potluck around the campfire, and the eighth graders run the s&rsquo;mores.</p></div></section></div></div>\n<section class=\"fsElement fsNavigation fsList nav-sub\"><header><h2 class=\"fsElementTitle\">In This Section</h2></header><div class=\"fsElementContent\"><nav><ul><li><a href=\"/student-life/voice-choice\">Voice &amp; Choice</a></li></ul></nav></div></section></main>\n<footer id=\"fsFooter\"><p>Helios School, Sunnyvale, CA</p></footer></body></html>\n"
}
